<section class="shell band">
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Finding Balance Counseling is the practice of Reem Glasco, LPC-S, in Cedar Park, Texas.
    Reem has held Texas LPC supervisor status since 2009 and is an EMDRIA Approved Consultant,
    a NARM therapist and a Somatic Experiencing Practitioner. She supervises LPC Associates
    online statewide at $425 a month, consults on EMDR at $185 an hour, and runs mindful trail
    and equine retreats for therapists. Clients seeking therapy are seen by Reem or by the
    practice's associates.</p>
  </div>
</section>

