<section class="band band--sand">
  <div class="shell split">
    <div>
      <h2>Hi, I am Reem</h2>
      <p>I have been supervising since 2009, and the associates I work best with want more than
      signed hours. They want to understand what is happening in the room, including what is
      happening in their own nervous system while a client is falling apart in front of them.</p>
      <p>My clinical centre is IFS-informed EMDR: processing that consults the protective parts
      of a person instead of overriding them. Somatic Experiencing sets the pace, NARM tracks
      the patterns underneath. That is what I teach, and it is what I practise.</p>
      <p>I expect you to show up prepared, be honest, and tell me when something goes wrong. In
      return you get help building a practice, not just a log.</p>
      <p><a href="/about/">My full background and credentials</a></p>
    </div>
